OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after motorcyclist dies in
OL,4,Acrash with car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fmotorcyclist died in a crash with a car
OL,8,Fnear Selby.
OL,10,FA red Audi saloon collided with a black
OL,11,Fmotorbike on the A63 Selby bypass, near
OL,12,FBarlby, at about 07:00 GMT, North
OL,13,FYorkshire Police said.
OL,15,FThe motorcycle rider, a local man in
OL,16,Fhis early 60s, died at the scene and
OL,17,Fhis family are being supported by
OL,18,Fpolice.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
